<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Dampens the recoil of all weapons in the game. Works both in the scope and when shooting from the hip. Suitable for most screen resolutions, in my case it was 1920x1080 and 1440x1080, so I think for other resolutions this jitter will work. Sensitivity in game: 0.7, ads mouse sensitivity: off. The most important thing is that it doesn't matter what DPI you have on your mouse, I checked on the range from 400 to 12000 DPI. The only inconvenience - too much shakes the sight, so it is difficult to use it in the game settings or inventory, but if you get used to it, then use the inventory is not so difficult. For the macro to work, set it to LMB - Operating mode: Run while you hold the key.</Description>
    <Comment></Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
MoveR 0 1
Delay 10 ms
